01:08:43.119 --> 01:08:44.586
IT WAS HANDS ON EVERY DAY WALKING THE DINING ROOM,

01:08:44.586 --> 01:08:48.124
CHECKING THE QUALITY OF FOOD HIMSELF, TREATING EVERY GUESTS

01:08:48.124 --> 01:08:50.993
LIKE THEY WERE WALKING INTO HIS OWN HOME.

01:08:50.993 --> 01:08:54.597
HIS COMMITMENT DIDN'T STOP AT THE RESTAURANT DOOR.

01:08:54.597 --> 01:08:58.467
FOR OVER 30 YEARS JO AND HIS FAMILY SERVED CHRISTMAS EVE

01:08:58.467 --> 01:09:02.405
PRIVATE DINNERS TO UNHOUSED AND LOW INCOME SAN FRANCISCANS

01:09:02.405 --> 01:09:05.608
